GAL22V10
VJMEMR5

MREQn RDn WRn A13 A14 A15 MODE0 MODE1 A11 A12 NC GND
NC ROMCEn RAMCEn MEMRDn MEMWRn NC NC NC NC NC NC VCC

; ROM: mode 0 owns 0000-3FFF; modes 1 and 2 own D800-FFFF.
/ROMCEn = /MREQn * /MODE1 * /MODE0 * /A15 * /A14
        + /MREQn * /MODE1 *  MODE0 *  A15 * A14 *  A13
        + /MREQn * /MODE1 *  MODE0 *  A15 * A14 * /A13 * A12 * A11
        + /MREQn *  MODE1 * /MODE0 *  A15 * A14 *  A13
        + /MREQn *  MODE1 * /MODE0 *  A15 * A14 * /A13 * A12 * A11

; SRAM always stops at D800. Below it: mode 0 excludes low ROM, mode 2
; excludes the 4000-BFFF cartridge hole, and modes 1/3 expose ordinary RAM.
/RAMCEn = /MREQn *  A15 *  A14 * /A13 * /A12
        + /MREQn *  A15 *  A14 * /A13 * /A11
        + /MREQn * /A15 * /A14 *  MODE1
        + /MREQn * /A15 * /A14 *  MODE0
        + /MREQn * /A15 *  A14 *  MODE0
        + /MREQn *  A15 * /A14 *  MODE0
        + /MREQn * /A15 *  A14 * /MODE1
        + /MREQn *  A15 * /A14 * /MODE1

/MEMRDn = /MREQn * /RDn
/MEMWRn = /MREQn * /WRn

DESCRIPTION

VJUGA rev B Memory-card U3, full four-mode overlay and D800 handoff.
